  "body": "Could you please explain to me why are there special schemas for whatwg URL and why we cannot change from one protocol to another without a silent error?\r\n\r\nExample\r\n```\r\nconst url = new URL('es://localhost:9200')\r\nurl.protocol = 'http'\r\n// outputs es://localhost:9200\r\n```\r\n\r\nWorkaround\r\n```\r\nconst url = new URL('es://localhost:9200')\r\nurl.protocol = 'httpx'\r\nurl.toString().replace(/httpx/, 'http')\r\n// outputs http://localhost:9200\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhy? I am really annoyed.",
